{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207530","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207530","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1720753001:1":{"text":"보세요! 역시 제가 맞았어요. 역시 이건 시련의 일부였네요!","source_cn":"看！我就知道！这果然是试炼的一部分！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2D2824CE6D13580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720753002:1":{"text":"저 두 녀석은 겉보기엔 무섭지만, 사실 별거 아니에요. 아직 제 실력을 발휘하지도 않았다고요!","source_cn":"那两个大家伙虽然看起来吓人，但也就是看着唬人罢了！本公...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA79DD3BD8BC15C54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720753003:1":{"text":"페기, 이건 시작일 뿐이니 방심하지 마. 뭐가 있을지 아무도 모르니까.","source_cn":"佩吉，不要大意。这只是开始，真正的危险可能还在后面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31A06FBBE81CE03E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720753004:1":{"text":"모두 잘 따라오고 있죠? 계속 가요! 뭐가 있든 반드시 유물들을 손에 넣겠어요!","source_cn":"继续前进吧！无论里面有什么，我都一定要拿到那四件遗物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C913A1F0EC9F4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"페기","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}